OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal cigarette plant could make
OL,4,A200,000 a day                          
OL,6,FA factory capable of producing more    
OL,7,Fthan 200,000 illegal cigarettes a day  
OL,8,Fhas been dismantled in Lincolnshire.   
OL,10,FThe processing plant was uncovered at  
OL,11,Fan industrial site in Bourne during a  
OL,12,Fseries of raids across England that led
OL,13,Fto 21 people being arrested.           
OL,15,FHM Revenue and Customs (HMRC) said the 
OL,16,Fwider operation led to the seizure of  
OL,17,F1.4 million illicit cigarettes and     
OL,18,Fabout 5.5 tonnes of tobacco, with an   
OL,19,Festimated duty value of #4.5m.         
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
