OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal cigarette plant could make
OL,4,A200,000 a day                          
OL,6,FMargaret Mousley, deputy director at   
OL,7,FHMRC's fraud investigation service,    
OL,8,Fsaid: "The sheer scale of what our     
OL,9,Fofficers uncovered shows this was a    
OL,10,Fwell-established operation capable of  
OL,11,Fputting millions of illicit cigarettes 
OL,12,Fon to UK streets."                     
